WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:00.734
Ukraine is

00:00:00.734 --> 00:00:01.735
now investigating

00:00:01.735 --> 00:00:03.870
these gruesome beheadings.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.504
Talk a little bit

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.639
about how you're doing that.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:07.941
So, unfortunately,

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:10.410
this is not the first atrocities

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.413
which Russian army made in Ukraine.

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.181
Unfortunately,

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:18.451
we can see many atrocities at all

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:20.520
its doors and of thousands

00:00:20.653 --> 00:00:22.722
atrocities and war crimes in Ukraine.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:27.360
So we ask for justice and we ask that

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:30.030
no one leader don't stay

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:30.797
in the back

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.432
or in the other side

00:00:32.432 --> 00:00:35.602
of these atrocities and support and

00:00:35.602 --> 00:00:37.437
bring this war crimes

00:00:37.437 --> 00:00:38.705
to the responsibility.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:40.740
Have you seen these kinds of beheadings

00:00:41.007 --> 00:00:42.776
of Ukrainian soldiers,

00:00:42.776 --> 00:00:45.278
supposedly by Russian troops in the past?

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.448
We can see other atrocities

00:00:48.448 --> 00:00:51.951
and they cut other parts of the bodies.

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:55.588
Our soldiers kill them after this.

00:00:55.588 --> 00:00:58.658
And just killings of prisoners of war

00:00:59.592 --> 00:01:01.528
In many ways, it's war crimes.

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.564
And this international court

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:06.666
is now investigating,

00:01:06.666 --> 00:01:08.635
investigating all of these cases.

00:01:08.635 --> 00:01:10.804
And security services

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:12.705
of Ukraine also investigate

00:01:12.705 --> 00:01:13.740
all of these cases.

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:15.875
And I am sure that we will find and

00:01:16.443 --> 00:01:17.677
bring to the responsibility

00:01:17.677 --> 00:01:19.412
all of this war crimes.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.880
And the main issue

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.249
is to bring to the responsibility

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:25.852
of this politicians, including Putin,

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:30.023
who made a crime of aggression.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:31.825
So how much responsibility

00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:33.359
do you believe Putin himself

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.462
has for these kinds of atrocities?

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:39.199
How much what do we mean?

00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:41.301
Do you believe that Putin himself

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:42.302
is responsible?

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:42.902
Absolutely.

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:44.170
He is responsible for

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.872
a crime of aggression.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:47.273
So he made

00:01:47.273 --> 00:01:49.342
this order to go into a head

00:01:49.576 --> 00:01:51.010
on the Ukrainian territory

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.046
and made all of these crimes,

00:01:53.046 --> 00:01:53.847
war crimes,

00:01:53.847 --> 00:01:56.483
which the Russian army made in Ukraine

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.651
and is making right now

00:01:58.651 --> 00:01:59.686
on Ukrainian territory.

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:01.754
You consider these work war crimes?

00:02:01.788 --> 00:02:04.324
Absolutely. It's crimes against humanity.

00:02:04.357 --> 00:02:06.226
And from my side,

00:02:06.226 --> 00:02:07.760
I estimate this like a heinous

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:08.027
hand of

00:02:08.027 --> 00:02:09.762
side of Ukrainian people

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:10.497
because they kill

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:11.731
not just

00:02:11.865 --> 00:02:15.001
prisoners of war, not just a Ukrainian

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.137
military service,

00:02:17.137 --> 00:02:18.872
but they kill civilians.

00:02:18.872 --> 00:02:19.672
Many children,

00:02:19.672 --> 00:02:20.573
more than

00:02:20.740 --> 00:02:22.175
a thousand children

00:02:22.175 --> 00:02:24.544
are killed by Russians in different ways.

00:02:24.711 --> 00:02:25.445
Not just

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:27.013
I know you're here in Washington.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.281
You had a chance earlier today

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:29.048
to meet with the defense

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.783
secretary, Lloyd Austin.

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.185
There's a dispute going

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:33.286
on, I understand, right now

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:33.987
between the U.S.

00:02:33.987 --> 00:02:35.889
and Ukraine over these leaked U.S.

00:02:35.889 --> 00:02:37.357
intelligence documents,

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:39.092
which seem to suggest

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.994
that Ukraine was not moving

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:42.662
ahead, did not have a good chance

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:44.297
of winning this war again

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:46.332
that Russia launched against Ukraine.

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:47.600
How did that conversation

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.636
with the defense secretary go?

00:02:49.636 --> 00:02:52.205
First of all, we discuss all our needs

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:53.473
because we are preparing

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:54.974
for our counteroffensive

00:02:54.974 --> 00:02:56.776
and we work very closely

00:02:56.776 --> 00:02:57.710
with our partners

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.378
and with

00:02:58.378 --> 00:02:59.979
especially with the United States,

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:01.748
with the secretary of defense.

00:03:01.748 --> 00:03:03.383
I'm really grateful

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.485
to secretary of defense for

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:08.121
strong and sustainable and unwavering

00:03:08.121 --> 00:03:09.689
support of Ukraine.

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.357
And it's very important

00:03:11.357 --> 00:03:12.992
that we are absolutely united

00:03:12.992 --> 00:03:14.627
and no

00:03:14.627 --> 00:03:16.462
special informational operations

00:03:16.462 --> 00:03:20.400
will never destroy our unity in our will

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.868
to win this war

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:24.571
and to liberate territories of Ukraine.

00:03:24.571 --> 00:03:27.740
And the main goal, to protect

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:31.144
civilized and democratic values

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:32.412
of the civilized world.

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:33.613
Is the leak of this U.S.

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:34.747
intelligence document

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:36.115
going to

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:37.283
change

00:03:37.283 --> 00:03:37.917
your plans

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:39.619
for some sort of counteroffensive,

00:03:39.619 --> 00:03:40.453
given what the U.S.

00:03:40.453 --> 00:03:41.588
intelligence community

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:43.590
apparently believes? Absolutely.

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:44.490
We are preparing

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.926
and nothing will not stop us

00:03:46.926 --> 00:03:48.995
and will not change our plans

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:51.030
to liberate our land.

00:03:51.030 --> 00:03:53.666
I know you at least for a long time,

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:54.834
for weeks and weeks

00:03:54.834 --> 00:03:55.468
have appealed

00:03:55.468 --> 00:03:56.336
to the United States

00:03:56.336 --> 00:03:58.871
for fighter jets, F-16s, among others.

00:03:59.205 --> 00:04:01.140
Anything change on that front?

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.775
So very important

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:03.710
right now

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.110
we have

00:04:04.110 --> 00:04:05.778
urgent needs for organization

00:04:05.778 --> 00:04:08.214
of next stage of counteroffensive.

00:04:08.448 --> 00:04:09.782
But in general,

00:04:09.782 --> 00:04:12.719
we need a name of security guarantees.

00:04:12.719 --> 00:04:14.721
We should develop our army.

00:04:14.721 --> 00:04:16.856
We should develop and train our soldiers.

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:19.225
So it will take time. We discussed this.

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:20.460
What did the defense

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.562
secretary tell you about fighter jets

00:04:22.562 --> 00:04:23.496
from the U.S.

00:04:23.496 --> 00:04:25.098
going to Ukraine?

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:25.932
We discuss discussed

00:04:25.932 --> 00:04:27.200
looks of our cooperation

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.601
with state secretary.

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:31.437
And I think that the last fourth is from

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:34.007
outside of United States of America.

